---
source: crates/cli/tests/native.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
Passwords from the system's secure generator

Usage: tw random password [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -l, --length <N>    Characters in each password
      --no-upper      Leave out: Uppercase letters, A to Z
      --no-lower      Leave out: Lowercase letters, a to z
      --no-digits     Leave out: Digits, 0 to 9
      --no-symbols    Leave out: The symbols !#$%&*+-=?@^_
      --no-lookalike  Leave out I, l, 1, O and 0, which are easily mistaken for one another
  -n, --count <N>     How many to generate, one a line
      --json          Write the result as JSON
      --no-newline    Do not end text output with a newline
  -h, --help          Print help
